  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women of Sun Grant - re-coding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Irish Representative Office in Ramallah, through the Palestine Head of Mission Fund, will support Women of the Sun, aiming to support women empowerment and increase their political participation.&#xa0;The objective of this project is to enhance the economic livelihoods of marginalized women through relevant, high-demand digital skills and promote women&#x2019;s empowerment and gender equality by enabling financial autonomy and visibility. The project will contribute to the realization of fundamental human rights, including economic participation and freedom of expression. Indirectly support greater participation of women in democratic processes by reducing dependency and expanding their public roles.</narrative>
  </description>
